# This directory will contain the API documentation for OCA.
#
# The documentation can be auto-generated from docstrings using a tool
# like Sphinx, MkDocs with `mkdocstrings`, or another documentation generator.
#
# The goal is to have comprehensive documentation for all public modules,
# classes, and functions, making it easy for contributors to understand
# the codebase.
#
# Example generated files might be:
# - `oca.core.session.md`
# - `oca.core.editor.md`
# - `oca.utils.git.md`
